# Build-time manifest URL read by Vite (import.meta.env.VITE_MANIFEST_URL).
# Copy this file to .env.development (and/or .env.production) and adjust.
#
# Development default — the dev server serves local/map-config.json here:
VITE_MANIFEST_URL=/local/map-config.json
#
# Production typically points at wherever the manifest is hosted, e.g.:
# VITE_MANIFEST_URL=/map-media/map-config.json
